      "prompt": "Scroll down to the bottom of the list. The headers scroll away! Freeze the top row so the headers always stay visible: right-click any cell and choose Freeze first row.",
      "teach": "**Freeze** pins rows or columns in place while the rest of the sheet scrolls. Freezing the **top row** keeps your headers on screen, which matters once a sheet has more rows than fit on the screen.",
