      "prompt": "Now freeze the first column as well, so the student names stay visible when you scroll right. Click B2, right-click it, and choose Freeze to active cell.",
      "teach": "To freeze rows **and** columns, click the cell just below and to the right of what you want frozen (here **B2**), then right-click and choose **Freeze to active cell**. Everything above and to the left of B2 stays put.",
